Package: thickness-local
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rajdeep Analytics <aadit@rajdeepanalytics.com>
Description: Thickness Monitoring System - fully local appliance
 Complete offline thickness monitoring: reads CD22 laser sensors over the
 local network, stores readings in an embedded database, and serves the
 dashboard at http://<this-machine> on the LAN. No internet connection is
 required or used. Activation via a signed license code from Rajdeep
 Analytics.
